<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>My Portfolio</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; color: #1f2933; background: #f9fafb; line-height: 1.6; }
    .navbar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 1rem 2rem; background: #1a2634; color: #fff; }
    .navbar .logo { color: #fff; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.15rem; text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-links { list-style: none; display: flex; gap: 1.25rem; }
    .nav-links a { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: #9cc3ff; }
    .hero { text-align: center; padding: 3rem 1.5rem 2rem; }
    .avatar { width: 120px; height: 120px; border-radius: 50%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #7c3aed); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: .3rem; }
    .tagline { color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    #btn { padding: .6rem 1.2rem; border: none; border-radius: 8px; background: #2563eb; color: #fff; cursor: pointer; font-size: 1rem; }
    #btn:hover { background: #1d4ed8; }
    .section { max-width: 800px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
    .section h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-bottom: .4rem; border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; }
    .project { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .project h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: .3rem; }
    .project p { color: #4b5563; font-size: .95rem; }
    .skill { display: inline-block; background: #eef2ff; color: #2563eb; padding: .35rem .8rem; border-radius: 999px; font-size: .85rem; margin: .25rem .25rem 0 0; }
    .contact a { color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none; }
    .site-footer { text-align: center; color: #9ca3af; font-size: .85rem; padding: 2rem 1rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .navbar { flex-direction: column; gap: .5rem; padding: 1rem; } .nav-links { gap: 1rem; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="navbar">
    <a class="logo" href="#">My Portfolio</a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="avatar">Y</div>
    <h1>Your Name</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Web Developer &amp; Designer</p>
    <button id="btn">Say hi</button>
  </div>
  <section id="about" class="section">
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <p>Hi! I'm a web developer. This is a short intro telling people who you are, what you do, and what you're passionate about. Replace this with your own story.</p>
  </section>
  <section id="projects" class="section">
    <h2>Projects</h2>
    <div class="project">
      <h3>Project One</h3>
      <p>A short description of what this project does and what you learned building it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="project">
      <h3>Project Two</h3>
      <p>Describe another project here — the problem it solves and the tools you used.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="skills" class="section">
    <h2>Skills</h2>
    <span class="skill">HTML</span>
    <span class="skill">CSS</span>
    <span class="skill">JavaScript</span>
    <span class="skill">Design</span>
  </section>
  <section id="contact" class="section contact">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Email me at <a href="mailto:you@example.com">you@example.com</a></p>
  </section>
  <footer class="site-footer">
    <p>&copy; 2026 Your Name</p>
  </footer>
  <script>
    var btn = document.getElementById('btn');
    if (btn) { btn.addEventListener('click', function () { btn.textContent = 'Hello! 👋'; }); }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
